+/*
+ * Motion stream for the LSM6DS3TR-C (6-axis accelerometer + gyroscope).
+ *
+ * While a client is subscribed, notifies 12 bytes every ACCEL_STREAM_INTERVAL_MS:
+ * six little-endian int16, ax ay az gx gy gz, in fixed units whatever the sensor's range:
+ * accel 0.122 mg/LSB, gyro 17.5 mdps/LSB (the +-4 g / +-500 dps scales).
+ * With no subscriber the sensor drops back to 12.5 Hz accel and gyro off.
+ *
+ * The sensor is powered by the board's lsm6dsl_en regulator (regulator-boot-on);
+ * this file no longer drives a GPIO of its own.
+ */
 
